summon water demons of their own, but they will not stop at 120 so
killing these extra ones do not count towards extinction (just like Archons
can summon monsters that are already extinct). You cannot reverse
genocide them (which doesn't count towards extinction anyway).

Another problem are (baby) monsters that become the bigger variant of
their race (baby green dragon -> green dragon). In your vanquished
foes list you will then see 119 baby green dragons. And as a matter of fact
you have killed only 119 (but killed an extra green dragon). You have to
decide for yourself how you define extinctionist. I my case I was happy with
a dungeon where no monsters could be summoned by 'create monster' anymore.

